us to easily develop and test

00:02:39.730 --> 00:02:41.520
against a satellite.

00:02:41.520 --> 00:02:45.650
First, a GCE VM is
being provisioned.

00:02:45.650 --> 00:02:47.590
And you're also pulling
in some variables

00:02:47.590 --> 00:02:51.190
from external files,
which are allowing

00:02:51.190 --> 00:02:53.740
you to use those
values without changing

00:02:53.740 --> 00:02:54.805
the playbooks themselves.

00:02:54.805 --> 00:02:55.930
TOM MELENDEZ: Right, Dylan.

00:02:55.930 --> 00:02:57.550
We use that technique
throughout our playbook

00:02:57.550 --> 00:02:59.300
so they can be
version-controlled, as well

00:02:59.300 --> 00:03:01.960
as be used to build
different environments.

00:03:01.960 --> 00:03:04.090
As you see in our
